{"id":"c1a7ac0ed2d66f54","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Subbase Generated Topology","display":"df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology — ZFC Top4 Subbase Generated Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology","58-df-zfc-topo10-subbase-generated-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology — ZFC Top4 Subbase Generated Topology","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology</span><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-subbase-generated-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-subbase-generated-topology — ZFC Top4 Subbase Generated Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6956c8a704f51c7\" href=\"?note=d6956c8a704f51c7\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal S,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6956c8a704f51c7\" href=\"?note=d6956c8a704f51c7\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(\\tau,X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(\\tau,X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为拓扑，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 的有限交在每个开集内局部成基，因此恰好刻画由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 生成的拓扑。</li>\n<li>topo10 仅调整参数顺序，是同一语义谓词的别名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md","status":"resolved","id":"d6956c8a704f51c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md","status":"resolved","id":"d6956c8a704f51c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\subseteq V^3$（见 [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-top-subbase.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal S,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S(\\mathcal S,X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}subbase\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(\\tau,X,\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop4SubbaseGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal S,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopSubbase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","displ